{"4617500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Revenant Survivors", "steam_appid": 4617500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4989260], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenant Survivors is a horde survival action roguelite where hard-hitting combat lets you carve through relentless hordes. In a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy world, absorb souls, steal the power of bosses, and evolve into something far more monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c64632c73710a8b3c725f207cae362f6.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a boss is more than a reward. Everything a fallen boss possessed can become your power. Absorb their soul to grow stronger, steal their skills and wield them yourself, claim the gear they leave behind, and take their very body to unlock a new playable character. After every boss kill, choose a Perk that can fundamentally change how your attacks work—and how the slaughter unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/ce8d1fcd4803cc0c8eba889ae3f9d13d.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b1825d837363c2b2985f3fb1de676179.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic Attacks, Active Skills, and Dominions evolve into new forms as they grow. Progression changes more than damage: it can alter their area, how many times they activate, how long they last, and even how they trigger. The same attack can evolve to sweep across the battlefield or strike again and again, taking on a completely different form and role depending on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a53a3da810e1b888b91ebb0c64d4d32b.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a53a3da810e1b888b91ebb0c64d4d32b.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a53a3da810e1b888b91ebb0c64d4d32b.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b01078d764343fa34a0be051965f1b9b.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b01078d764343fa34a0be051965f1b9b.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/b01078d764343fa34a0be051965f1b9b.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire, Frost, Lightning, Light, and Dark attacks build up different Elemental Debuffs on enemies. While they stack, each debuff applies its own weakening effect. Once an Elemental Debuff is fully stacked, use an Active Skill to Shatter it. The built-up element erupts all at once, dealing Shatter Damage and triggering a unique additional effect for that element.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/273c19f8d28076d6223c4d88ebd06554.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/67f640cfb6e03f6b6c5c97e699077e66.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At each level-up, choose Dominions, Basic Attacks, Active Skills, and Passives to lay the foundation of your build. Perks chosen after defeating bosses can dramatically reshape how your attacks work and how combat flows—for example, by keeping Whirlwind active continuously. Add new effects and synergies with Relics, then push your build further with equipment and Set Effects to create a combat style of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your growth doesn't end when the battle does. Use souls earned on the battlefield to expand the Soul Altar and unlock new Dominions and progression choices. Craft and enhance equipment, and use permanent progression systems to strengthen both Player Abilities and Character Abilities. Return stronger to take on new battlefields and higher difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/17fafa89233c382745e553a561e980eb.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revenant Survivors is a horde survival action roguelite where hard-hitting combat lets you carve through relentless hordes. In a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy world, absorb souls, steal the power of bosses, and evolve into something far more monstrous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/c2835ccd43b1644f76d281aa9d3eedf8.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=