inions, Basic Attacks, Active Skills, and Passives to lay the foundation of your build. Perks chosen after defeating bosses can dramatically reshape how your attacks work and how combat flows—for example, by keeping Whirlwind active continuously. Add new effects and synergies with Relics, then push your build further with equipment and Set Effects to create a combat style of your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=146 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/2a629cb7e222a53d48179ee63352be37.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.poster.avif?t=1787616169\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.webm?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/extras/a086315e58bc7d702bcb9b7e898ec047.mp4?t=1787616169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your growth doesn't end when the battle does. Use souls earned on the battlefield to expand the Soul Altar and unlock new Dominions and progression choices. Craft and enhance equipment, and use permanent progression systems to strengthen both Player Abilities and Character Abilities. Return stronger to take on new battlefields and higher difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Revenant Survivors is a horde survival action roguelite set in a Diablo-inspired dark fantasy world. Tear through endless hordes with hard-hitting combat, absorb souls, and steal bosses' skills—even their bodies—to become evil incarnate.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/2d27daa328161dc872d1297ccb23ad59ff769bdc/header.jpg?t=1787616169", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/05fbf24a5634041c21a9dee866164b2be9ccd5da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787616169", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4617500/05fbf24a5634041c21a9dee866164b2be9ccd5da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787616169", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-8350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050 (2GB) / AMD RX 560 / Intel Arc A380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1660 Super / RTX 2060 / AMD RX 5600 XT<br></li><li><